{"n":104,"name":"Al-Humazah","nameAr":"الهمزة","meaning":"The Traducer","ayahs":9,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ","en":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","w":[{"ar":"وَيْلٌۭ","tr":"waylun","en":"Woe"},{"ar":"لِّكُلِّ","tr":"likulli","en":"to every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"هُمَزَةٍۢ","tr":"humazatin","en":"slanderer","root":"همز","lem":"هُمَزَة"},{"ar":"لُّمَزَةٍ","tr":"lumazatin","en":"backbiter","root":"لمز","lem":"لُمَزَة"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","en":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","w":[{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"The one who"},{"ar":"جَمَعَ","tr":"jamaʿa","en":"collects","root":"جمع","lem":"جَمَعَ"},{"ar":"مَالًۭا","tr":"mālan","en":"wealth","root":"مول","lem":"مال"},{"ar":"وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","tr":"waʿaddadahu","en":"and counts it","root":"عدد","lem":"عَدَّدَ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","w":[{"ar":"يَحْسَبُ","tr":"yaḥsabu","en":"Thinking","root":"حسب","lem":"حَسِبَ"},{"ar":"أَنَّ","tr":"anna","en":"that"},{"ar":"مَالَهُۥٓ","tr":"mālahu","en":"his wealth","root":"مول","lem":"مال"},{"ar":"أَخْلَدَهُۥ","tr":"akhladahu","en":"will make him immortal","root":"خلد","lem":"أَخْلَدَ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","en":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","w":[{"ar":"كَلَّا ۖ","tr":"kallā","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","tr":"layunbadhanna","en":"Surely he will be thrown","root":"نبذ","lem":"نَبَذَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","tr":"l-ḥuṭamati","en":"the Crusher","root":"حطم","lem":"حُطَمَة"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","tr":"adrāka","en":"will make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"wha